<title>USA: Collins fails to reach wheelchair sale deal.</title>
<headline>Collins fails to reach wheelchair sale deal.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Kansas 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collins Industries Inc said on Monday it was unable to reach a definitive agreement with the Braun Corp regarding the sale of certain assets of its wheelchair lift product line.</p>
<p>Collins said it continued to sell its wheelchair lift products through its Mobile Tech Corp subsidiary.</p>
<p>Wheelchair lift products have historically represented about three percent of the company's consolidated sales and have not contributed to net earnings in recent years, it said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
